{
    "word": "aperçu",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d599ef07-e41a-305d-9d7c-0144b34ca1ce",
                "word": "aperçu",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5903faea-926b-4ab9-ac6b-877da0d08d73",
                        "entry_id": "d599ef07-e41a-305d-9d7c-0144b34ca1ce",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "aperçus"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "25993f59-d6c1-3b65-ade7-0f361a1daa02",
                        "entry_id": "d599ef07-e41a-305d-9d7c-0144b34ca1ce",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A clever insight."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bcd54e6-8bc0-45ee-8ae5-c79cf5f45b6d",
                                "sense_id": "25993f59-d6c1-3b65-ade7-0f361a1daa02",
                                "text": "I insisted on how his opinion mattered, and developed and construed his platitudes into aperçus he was far from entertaining himself."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ebea526b-59fd-4acb-b989-9c4de5f1fa00",
                                "sense_id": "25993f59-d6c1-3b65-ade7-0f361a1daa02",
                                "text": "In this place you can go to a year's worth of dinner parties without hearing anyone quote an aperçu he first heard on Charlie Rose."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e3b7e94-89b3-42c3-966f-64475812bbca",
                                "sense_id": "25993f59-d6c1-3b65-ade7-0f361a1daa02",
                                "text": "Every so often a hobo (Mr. [Tom] Hanks again) materializes to dispense a cryptic aperçu to the boy, maybe because the child is the father of the man or because the film's envelope-pushing gobbled up most of the budget and there was only enough money for one star."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ccbaf53c-e455-4af6-8a4e-a9542643102d",
                                "sense_id": "25993f59-d6c1-3b65-ade7-0f361a1daa02",
                                "text": "President [Barack] Obama disdains sound bites, and he does not have Bill Clinton's talent for reducing the abstruse to aperçus."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0c06e1d-3b76-425f-bb25-873ae6d549f3",
                                "sense_id": "25993f59-d6c1-3b65-ade7-0f361a1daa02",
                                "text": "While we know – because the script tells us so – that the people we are watching are in love and in pain and in trouble, they never come across as more than dispensers of sparkling aperçus."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "245e5e37-876f-4a14-bdb3-6c8d8597d435",
                                "sense_id": "25993f59-d6c1-3b65-ade7-0f361a1daa02",
                                "text": "These paragraphs contain many freighted aperçus, formulations over which debates continue to rage, such as that ‘[t]he executive of the modern state is but a committee for managing the common affairs of the whole bourgeoisie’ (1.12); […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "764e1ae1-b3ea-3434-9a7a-6054e783410e",
                        "entry_id": "d599ef07-e41a-305d-9d7c-0144b34ca1ce",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An outline or summary; also, words that summarize."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4a7b9d63-8661-4456-aadc-7b5789d97ff3",
                        "source_entry_id": "d599ef07-e41a-305d-9d7c-0144b34ca1ce",
                        "source_sense_description": "clever insight",
                        "target_lang_word": "Aperçu",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Aperçu",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a22ea5c-93df-3955-83dd-ebb43d433114",
                                        "entry_id": "a9846315-6da7-3d89-98b2-580ac89f3123",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "geistreiche Bemerkung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "gehoben"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7214b381-3032-40aa-8d5e-c2fe78d930d2",
                                                "sense_id": "3a22ea5c-93df-3955-83dd-ebb43d433114",
                                                "text": "„Was aber Madame Permaneder anging, so war sie glücklich, so äußerte ihre lichte Gemütsstimmung sich in Aperçus wie diesem, dass das irdische Leben doch hin und wieder auch seine guten Seiten habe.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1b0fe7e-7efd-447b-a946-36de08d2da29",
                                                "sense_id": "3a22ea5c-93df-3955-83dd-ebb43d433114",
                                                "text": "„Er selbst besaß diesen Mut nicht immer und zog es – wie üblich – meist vor, geistreiche, richtungsweisende oder schlicht brillante Aperçus zu formulieren.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d80b9aa9-c02d-4f72-89a3-e306087edc30",
                                                "sense_id": "3a22ea5c-93df-3955-83dd-ebb43d433114",
                                                "text": "„Doch so sehr auf Wohlleben bedacht Murr auch sein mag, er ist ein vollständiges Individuum mit Gefühlen und Gedanken, das in langen, verworren geschwätzigen Aperçus die simplistische Philosophie entwickelt, die seinem Temperament ansteht.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
